{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"自由单子"},0],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"title":[{"Plain":"自由单子"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"单子","text":"单子"}},{"Plain":"是自函子范畴中的"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数","text":"结合代数"}},{"Plain":"; 自由单子就是这种代数中的"},{"Local":{"url":"自由-遗忘伴随","text":"自由"}},{"Plain":"代数.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>树的自由单子</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"树","text":"树"}},{"Plain":" 上的自由单子通过如下具体过程给出. 对于树\n$$\r\nT = (I\\overset{s}{\\leftarrow} E \\overset{p}{\\to} B \\overset{t}{\\to} I),\r\n$$\n记</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\operatorname{Sub}(T) := \\mathsf{TEmb}_{/T}^{\\simeq}$ 为 $T$ 的子树的集合 ($\\mathsf{TEmb}$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"树","text":"树"}},{"Plain":"及含入构成的范畴),</li>\n<li>$\\operatorname{Sub}'(T)$ 为 $T$ 的带一个标记叶的子树的集合.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>那么树 $T$ (对应的"},{"Local":{"url":"多项式函子","text":"多项式函子"}},{"Plain":")的<strong>自由单子</strong>即是如下多项式函子:\n$$\r\n\\overline{T} = (I \\leftarrow \\operatorname{Sub}'(T) \\to \\operatorname{Sub}(T) \\to I).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>事实上, 上述构造对一般的"},{"Local":{"url":"多项式函子","text":"多项式函子"}},{"Plain":"也是成立的.</p>\n<h3>自函子的自由单子</h3>\n<p><strong>命题</strong> (参考 "},{"Local":{"url":"GHK-analytic-monads","text":"GHK"}},{"Plain":" 4.2 节). 设范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 具有"},{"Local":{"url":"滤余极限","text":"滤余极限"}},{"Plain":"和二元"},{"Local":{"url":"和(范畴论)","text":"和"}},{"Plain":", 自函子 $P\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$ 保持"},{"Local":{"url":"滤余极限","text":"滤余极限"}},{"Plain":". 记 $\\mathsf{alg}_P(\\mathcal C)$ 为 $P$-Lambek 代数 (即对象 $X$ 带有态射 $\\alpha\\colon P(X)\\to X$ 的结构) 的范畴. 那么有"},{"Local":{"url":"单子性函子","text":"单子性"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"自由-遗忘伴随","text":"自由–遗忘伴随"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nF\\colon \\mathcal C \\rightleftarrows \\mathsf{alg}_{P}(\\mathcal C)\\colon U,\r\n$$\n且这对伴随"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随给出单子","text":"给出的单子"}},{"Plain":" $\\overline{P}$ 正是自函子 $P$ 上的自由单子. 进一步有\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\overline{P}}(\\mathcal C) \\simeq \\mathsf{alg}_P(\\mathcal C).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}